---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
import '../../styles/academic-project.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`GASP Violations Dashboard | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Data analytics capstone project visualizing air quality violations and fines in Allegheny County." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="academic-project">
			<div class="project-header">
				<p class="project-context">Data Science Capstone · January - April 2025</p>
				<h1>Visualizing Industrial Impact in Allegheny County</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">A data analytics capstone project for GASP (Group Against Smog & Pollution) visualizing 5 years of air quality violations and fines from major industrial polluters.</p>
				<p class="project-context">Group Against Smog and Pollution (GASP) · University of Pittsburgh</p>
				<ul class="technologies" aria-label="Technologies used">
					<li>Looker Studio</li>
					<li>Microsoft Excel</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<figure class="project-figure">
				<a href="/assets/images/projects/gasp-dashboard.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View GASP dashboard screenshot at full size">
					<img src="/assets/images/projects/gasp-dashboard.webp" width="1634" height="868" alt="GASP dashboard showing Pittsburgh-area facilities on a map alongside violation types and counts" loading="lazy" />
				</a>
				<figcaption>The dashboard brings facility locations, violation types, and counts into one view. Select the image to view it at full size.</figcaption>
			</figure>

			<section class="prose glass-card">
				<h2>About this Project</h2>
				<p>This project was developed in Spring 2025 as a Data Science Capstone collaboration with the Group Against Smog & Pollution (GASP). The Looker Studio dashboard maps facilities and analyzes air quality violations and associated fines issued against steel and coke facilities in southwestern Pennsylvania between 2020 and 2024.</p>
				<p>This dashboard was the result of a highly collaborative, team-based effort built alongside five other undergraduate students. We collaborated with GASP stakeholders to gather requirements and refine the dashboard content around their advocacy goals.</p>
				<p>The dashboard provides an interactive look at the nature of these violations (such as exceedances of emission limits and operational failures) and visualizes the millions of dollars in fines levied against major polluters like U.S. Steel's Clairton Coke Works and Edgar Thomson Plant.</p>
				<a href="https://www.gasp-pgh.org/violations-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="project-link">View Live Dashboard on GASP</a>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
